{"id":"idpu_p285y","name":"Tether","domain":"tether.to","claimed":false,"description":"Tether Holdings operates a platform to store, send, and receive local currency person to person globally.","longDescription":"Tether is a leading brand in the cryptocurrency space, renowned for its innovative approach to digital finance. As the official home of Tether, the company specializes in providing a stablecoin solution that bridges the gap between traditional currencies and the increasingly digital financial ecosystem. Tether’s flagship product, the USDT (Tether USD), is pegged to the US dollar, making it a reliable choice for traders and investors seeking stability in the volatile crypto market. With a commitment to transparency and reliability, Tether offers its users the ability to seamlessly transfer value across blockchain networks. This ensures that individuals and businesses can facilitate transactions efficiently, while mitigating the risks associated with fluctuating cryptocurrency prices. Tether's services support a wide range of applications, from trading on exchanges to remittances and everyday purchases, making it an essential tool for those navigating the digital economy. By prioritizing user trust and easy accessibility, Tether continues to be a cornerstone in the evolution of financial systems globally.","links":[{"name":"youtube","url":"https://youtube.com/youtube.com/@tether_io"},{"name":"twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/x.com/tether"},{"name":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/instagram.com/_tether_"},{"name":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/linkedin.com/company/tether"},{"name":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/facebook.com/tether.to"}],"logos":[{"theme":"light","formats":[{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idpu_p285y/theme/light/logo.svg?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":"transparent","format":"svg","height":41,"width":184,"size":4197},{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idpu_p285y/w/800/h/178/theme/light/logo